				"A very preety Asian girl.Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, 8K high definition, street photography texture. Same face throughout, same hair color\n  consistent throughout, jet-black long hair with no dye, no two-tone hair, no difference between roots and ends, no hair color\n  change, maintain realistic hair texture and natural physics. Shoes remain a complete matching pair, left and right consistent, no\n  shoe changes or continuity errors. Outfits in order: Outfit 1 through Outfit 7, switching via hard cuts.\n\n  0–1.5s | Subject: Same young Asian woman, Figure 8. Wearing Outfit 1, black shoulder bag on left shoulder. Setting: Modern urban\n  street corner, dark gray irregular stone pavement, black metal railing as blurred foreground at bottom of frame, gray cylindrical\n  bollards visible in distance, background curves with the street corner arc. Action: Walking from frame right to frame left, left\n  hand holding phone to ear on a call, right hand swings naturally then lifts to gently brush back hair on right side, hair strands\n  flowing in the breeze, relaxed stride. Camera: Fixed position, slightly overhead angle, medium shot.\n\n  1.5–3s | Subject: Same woman, wearing Outfit 2, black sunglasses. Setting: City street crosswalk area, dark gray stone pavement\n  intersected by white zebra stripes, pedestrians' legs and bicycle wheels passing in distant background. Action: Both hands holding\n  open a magazine in front of face, walking forward while looking down to read, steady stride, magazine swaying slightly with\n  movement. Camera: Fixed position, slightly overhead angle, full shot.\n\n  3–4.5s | Subject: Same woman, wearing Outfit 3, black shoulder bag on left shoulder. Setting: City street crosswalk, dark gray\n  stone pavement, crisp white zebra stripes, a cyclist passing quickly on the left. Action: Striding forward in large steps, right\n  hand lifts to lightly touch chin and collar area, left hand swings naturally, clothing swaying naturally with the walk. Camera:\n  Fixed position, slightly overhead angle, full shot.\n\n  4.5–6s | Subject: Same woman, wearing Outfit 4, carrying a light pink handbag. Setting: City street crosswalk, dark gray stone\n  pavement, white zebra stripes, road surface clean with no debris. Action: Both hands holding bag straps, looking down into the\n  bag, then looks up toward camera with a gentle warm smile, continues walking forward. Camera: Fixed position, slightly overhead\n  angle, medium shot.\n\n  6–7.5s | Subject: Same woman, wearing Outfit 5, flat-brim straw boater hat with black ribbon. Setting: City street crosswalk, dark\n  gray stone pavement, white zebra stripes, a yellow shared-bicycle wheel passing through upper left of frame. Action: Left arm\n  holding a kraft paper bag (baguette and red berries peeking out), looking down at the road while walking forward, hat brim\n  slightly shading upper half of face, elegant stride. Camera: Fixed position, slightly overhead angle, full shot.\n\n  7.5–9s | Subject: Same woman, wearing Outfit 6, black sunglasses. Setting: City street crosswalk, dark gray stone pavement, white\n  zebra stripes, sunlight casting diagonal light-and-shadow stripes across the ground. Action: Both hands tucked into black trouser\n  pockets, striding forward in large steps, shoulders swinging naturally, cool and commanding presence. Camera: Fixed position,\n  slightly overhead angle, full shot.\n\n  9–11s | Subject: Same woman, wearing Outfit 7, holding a bouquet of purple flowers (wrapped in kraft paper). Setting: City street\n  crosswalk, dark gray stone pavement, white zebra stripes. Action: Continuing to walk forward, gentle and relaxed expression,\n  flowers held naturally in both hands, soft breeze stirring hair tips. Camera: Fixed position, slightly overhead angle, medium  shot.\n"
